{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"da9100935fe2056e4e6f8763943047de994d22c2d7f718167282c5f433546594","digest":{"component_or_area":"identity subsystem documentation and ADR","key_entities":["docs/identity.md","docs/adr/0045-authenticated-identity.md","src/rebar/identity",".rebar/current_identity","rebar identity","identity.require_authenticated","rebar.authorship.v1","is_placeholder","identity key add","identity key revoke","rebar verify-authorship","Modify-Reporter permission","scripts/check_docs_index.py"],"problem_keywords":["identity model documentation","authenticated identity","architectural decision record","key rotation","Jira mapping","event attribution","authorship attestation","TOFU genesis","provider-neutral","identity tiers","placeholder identities"],"propositions":["End-to-end identity model documentation is missing, preventing operators and agents from adopting authenticated identity with concrete examples and rationale.","Architectural decisions for identity (git-bug-style entity, opaque-id keying, in-band TOFU) are not formally recorded as an ADR, making future maintainability and rationale unclear.","Identity tiers (real vs. placeholder), key rotation with epoch-scoping, and the critical merge-gate-is-the-control enforcement caveat lack documented explanation.","Provider-neutral Jira mapping (accountId, /user/search bootstrap, Modify-Reporter constraint) and degradation behavior require formal documentation.","New documentation files must be added to the docs index to keep the docs-index completeness gate passing."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819712432606487,"uuid":"baf1641a-8557-425d-ace7-92e11267ad4c"}